## Third-party attribution

### Mangayomi
- Project: Mangayomi — https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi
- Licence: Apache License 2.0
- Copyright: the Mangayomi contributors

Mieru is an independent Kotlin/Compose client and contains no Mangayomi source code. Several
features and design decisions were inspired by Mangayomi, and are credited here because the
debt is real even where the code is not shared:

| Borrowed concept | Mangayomi origin | Where it lives here |
|---|---|---|
| A list of interchangeable content sources instead of one hard-coded host | `lib/eval`, `extension_store_service`, `source_repository` | `data/SourceStore.kt`, Settings → Sources |
| Skipping openings/endings | `lib/services/aniskip.dart` | `data/SkipTime.kt`, `ui/player/SkipPill.kt` |
| Playback speed, "up next" countdown, hold-to-boost | `lib/modules/anime` | `ui/player/PlaybackSpeed.kt`, `UpNextCard.kt`, `PlayerGestures.kt` |

Mangayomi is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. If any of its source is ever copied
into this project, that copy must keep its copyright and licence notices, and this notice must be
updated to say which files are derived from it.

